{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"馬太福音","commonName":"馬太福音","title":"馬太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"91a01a9d2852a1096cdedbf305ffd3780f39083c509861f515306fc3cd56733a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["施洗約翰傳道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，有施洗的約翰出來，在猶太的曠野傳道，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「天國近了，你們應當悔改！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["這人就是先知以賽亞所說的。他說：「在曠野有人聲喊着說：",{"text":"預備主的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修直他的路！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這約翰身穿駱駝毛的衣服，腰束皮帶，吃的是蝗蟲、野蜜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那時，耶路撒冷和猶太全地，並約旦河一帶地方的人，都出去到約翰那裏，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["承認他們的罪，在約旦河裏受他的洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["約翰看見許多法利賽人和撒都該人也來受洗，就對他們說：「毒蛇的種類！誰指示你們逃避將來的忿怒呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們要結出果子來，與悔改的心相稱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不要自己心裏說：『有亞伯拉罕為我們的祖宗。』我告訴你們，上帝能從這些石頭中給亞伯拉罕興起子孫來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["現在斧子已經放在樹根上，凡不結好果子的樹就砍下來，丟在火裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我是用水給你們施洗，叫你們悔改。但那在我以後來的，能力比我更大，我就是給他提鞋也不配。他要用聖靈與火給你們施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他手裏拿着簸箕，要揚淨他的場，把麥子收在倉裏，把糠用不滅的火燒盡了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌受洗"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["當下，耶穌從加利利來到約旦河，見了約翰，要受他的洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["約翰想要攔住他，說：「我當受你的洗，你反倒上我這裏來嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶穌回答說：「你暫且許我，因為我們理當這樣盡諸般的義",{"noteId":2},"。」於是約翰許了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶穌受了洗，隨即從水裏上來。天忽然為他開了，他就看見上帝的靈彷彿鴿子降下，落在他身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["從天上有聲音說：「這是我的愛子，我所喜悅的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：禮","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}